OL,3,GNEWSACarving a career from rock pooling
OL,4,Apassion
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I've been nipped by crabs, pinched by
OL,7,Fa lobster, bitten by fish and stung by
OL,8,Fa sea anemone - but that's just part of
OL,9,Fthe game," says Colin Sokell.
OL,11,FHe started exploring the Devon
OL,12,Fcoastline at the age of three during
OL,13,Fangling trips with his grandfather -
OL,14,Fand a lifelong passion was born.
OL,16,FSokell now spends hours clambering
OL,17,Falong Torbay's coast, searching
OL,18,Ftirelessly for "alien-like" sea hares
OL,19,For cunningly concealed top-knot flat
OL,20,Ffish.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
