OL,3,GNEWSACarving a career from rock pooling
OL,4,Apassion
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe shares his encounters with about
OL,7,F130,000 followers on social media: "I
OL,8,Fwas unemployed and thought 'I'm going
OL,9,Fto be a weirdo and go down to the beach
OL,10,Fand film what I do' - and it has grown
OL,11,Ffrom there."
